WEBVTT

00:01.520 --> 00:04.500
Regarding Yu Gong, it shall be handled as you proposed.

00:05.240 --> 00:07.200
Your son thanks Imperial Father!

00:07.520 --> 00:14.600
Second Son, you are circumspect and prudent, always striving to accommodate every detail... yet you border on indecisiveness.

00:14.960 --> 00:17.000
Zhen has a word of warning for you.
